WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:09.790
There is news that is pushing the virus closer
to Donald Trump himself.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:13.360
The president has a bunch of what are called
the valets.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.480
They're sort of like personal assistants in
a lot of ways.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.730
And these are some of the closest people to
presidents of the United States.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.680
They're often from the U.S. Navy.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.519
They deal with food, drink.

00:00:24.519 --> 00:00:28.920
When Trump is at the residence, when Trump
is traveling, they cater to the needs of the

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:29.920
first family.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.920
In many cases.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.080
These are people that are really close to
the president physically.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.739
And often they are they are close in a relationship
sense as well.

00:00:36.739 --> 00:00:42.160
One of Donald Trump's personal valets has
tested positive for Corona virus.

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.010
The valet started having symptoms Wednesday
morning, tested positive.

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:51.050
And Donald Trump is notified about this.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:57.640
We know that the virus can take two to 14
days from infection to symptoms.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:01.620
It's an average of five days before you show
symptoms.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:06.490
And presumably this is a valet that has continued
to be in close contact with Donald Trump.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:10.540
The White House has not said that the valet
was not around Donald Trump.

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:16.070
So based on how this administration works,
we probably can assume that the valet was

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:18.170
around Donald Trump during this time.

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.140
The White House continues not to enforce social
distancing for staffers.

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:27.409
Reports are that very few people at the White
House are wearing masks.

00:01:27.409 --> 00:01:28.880
Valets are not wearing masks.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:33.710
The physical distance is not being adhered
to very strictly at the White House.

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:37.510
Now, here's my question for you, and I really
want to think this through.

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:42.579
If Trump but Trump was tested right away when
the valet tested positive, Trump was tested

00:01:42.579 --> 00:01:43.900
once again.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:48.880
If Trump tested positive for Corona virus,
but he didn't immediately need to go to a

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.719
hospital, for example, would they admit it?

00:01:51.719 --> 00:01:54.219
Would they say that the president has tested
positive?

00:01:54.219 --> 00:02:00.810
There's a North Korea like gist to this administration
where I don't know that they would admit that

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:04.890
the great orange leader in this case has tested
positive.

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.990
I also.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:11.959
This is a different story, but I also would
not put it outside the realm of possibility

00:02:11.959 --> 00:02:17.400
that Trump and Pence have been prophylactically
receiving antibody transfusions.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:21.640
The convalescent plasma you're talking about
the president and the vise president, it wouldn't

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.640
be crazy.

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:24.629
It's not even like, oh my God, they're Recy.

00:02:24.629 --> 00:02:29.989
It would actually just seem almost like that
seems relatively safe and it seems to be effective

00:02:29.989 --> 00:02:34.240
at treating or dealing with the virus when
people have it.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:37.540
It wouldn't be completely out of this world
to think maybe Trump and Pence have been getting

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:39.370
prophylactic transfusions.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:44.670
But the real story is, has Donald Trump been
exposed?

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:47.010
What are the results of Donald Trump's test?

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:51.379
Has he been taking chloroquine prophylactically
as he advocated for a while might?

00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:53.830
My guess is the answer is no.

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:59.080
And right away, when this news was released
about the valet testing, positive rumors started

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:04.730
